ng to woo  jasmine with the help of genie disguised  as a bee he lists off a number of  desirable qualities like wonderful  magnificent glorious and punctual  punctual  punctual sorry years later in mulan  as she is writing down qualities that a  husband looks for in a wife  she ends with you guessed it punctual  disney animators are some of the best in  the world and it's all  in the details when it came to designing  all of the animals that maui would  transform into for moana  they made sure to hide in one very  specific element that  only the most eagle-eyed fans would  notice every time maui transforms  if you look closely you can see that his  hook is included somewhere in the  animal's markings  animation is a great way for filmmakers  to sneak important details into their  character designs that tell us so much  about who the character is  in the lion king one hidden message is  the way scar  was a warning all along most cats  including the big ones  keep their claws retracted until they  need to use them but if you look  carefully at scar  you'll see that his claws are always out  meaning that he's defensive and angry  and  always ready to fight and you couldn't  even dispose of them  ego from ratatouille starts out as just  a ruthless food critic  but one detail that we barely noticed  the first time around  shows just how much he has changed by  the end one of his famous lines is  if i don't love it i don't  swallow and at the beginning of the  movie  it's clear he hasn't enjoyed or  swallowed food in a really long time  but when we see him at the end after  having his life changed by the delicious  ratatouille he looks much healthier  happier and like he actually swallows  his food now  good for him  in one quick scene in the incredibles we  see two old men  talking about the super family and  complimenting them on being old school  it turns out that those two old men were  actually animated versions of real-life  disney animators frank thomas and ollie 